1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,560
Good morning, and thanks for joining the quarterly planning review.

2
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:06,880
I want to start with the archive digitization project.

3
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:09,040
We finished the pilot last month.

4
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:14,040
1400 reels were inspected, and about 900 of them are in good enough condition to run

5
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:16,840
through the transfer station without any baking.

6
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:19,480
The second item is the transcription backlog.

7
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:24,640
We have roughly 600 hours of board meetings and public lectures sitting on hard drives.

8
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:29,240
Once the loudness normalization step is in place, the automated pass should handle most

9
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:30,600
of it overnight.

10
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:34,960
Last thing, Dana asked whether we can publish captions alongside the video.

11
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:40,480
The answer is yes, the pipeline already emits subtitle files, so it is a matter of wiring

12
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:41,840
them into the player.

13
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:44,000
Let us pick this back up in two weeks.

14
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,520
Thanks, everyone.
